{"product":{"id":9728659882209,"title":"JEFFREY 106","body_html":"<p>The Jeffrey 106 is our all-mountain ATV: a 106mm freestyle ski built to cover everything from West Coast pow to park laps.</p>\n<p>For 26/27, the Jeffrey 106 receives an updated Bi-Radius Sidecut, a stiffer core profile, and our Delta Taper. Combined with Signature Rocker, these updates create one of the most stable and responsive mid-fat freestyle twins we’ve ever built. The added torsional stiffness improves edge hold and stability, while the tapered tail makes the ski easier to pivot and release through powder and variable snow. A compact turning radius and wide shovel let it carve hard while providing the float expected from a do-it-all Western platform. Deceptively agile for its width and satisfyingly beefy for its quickness, the Jeffrey 106 is our flagship mid-fat: a definitive quiver killer you can load up and trust wherever the day takes you.</p>\n<p>Every Jeffrey 106 is built with our custom 2800 hybrid fiberglass/carbon composite, a 100% bamboo core, full-length UHMW sidewalls, and the thickest bases and edges in skiing. The result is a stable, playful, and durable mid-fat freestyle ski designed to take a beating.</p>","vendor":"ON3P","product_type":"Skis","created_at":"2026-09-15T20:19:01-07:00","handle":"jeffrey-106","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:40-07:00","published_at":"2026-09-20T14:30:39-07:00","template_suffix":"ski","published_scope":"global","tags":"26.27, Jeffrey, Stock Ski","variants":[{"id":49128496759009,"product_id":9728659882209,"title":"161cm / Onyx","price":"899.00","sku":"27ON3PJF106161","position":1,"inventory_policy":"deny","compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"161cm","option2":"Onyx","option3":null,"created_at":"2026-09-15T20:19:01-07:00","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:40-07:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0,"weight_unit":"lb","inventory_quantity":4,"old_inventory_quantity